WinAFL (Ivan Fratric)
---------------------

  As the name implies, allows you to fuzz Windows binaries (using DynamoRio).

  https://github.com/ivanfratric/winafl

  Another Windows alternative may be:

  https://github.com/carlosgprado/BrundleFuzz/

